{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01G5Q52wfm188d2hRNzUAyA9","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# ColliForce-VLA Paper Framing\n2\t\n3\t> 维护者: Director | 最后更新: 2026-05-26 UTC | D023 修正：30K collapse 叙事被推翻，SDF 效果跨步数一致 | Post-MVP research phase\n4\t\n5\t## Core Insight\n6\t\n7\tVLA safety 评估存在系统性缺陷：collision avoidance rate (CAR) 被 action collapse 和几何路径安全严重污染，导致 \"安全\" 指标虚高。我们通过大规模实证分析（70+ 实验, 6000+ episodes）揭示这一系统性缺陷，提出 EE displacement-filtered CAR 作为修正指标，并证明 SDF auxiliary loss 能产生真实碰撞避免——但代价极端。\n8\t\n9\t## Working Title\n10\t\n11\t\"Rethinking VLA Safety Evaluation: When 98% of Collision Avoidance is an Illusion\"\n12\t\n13\t> 聚焦评估方法论贡献（影响面广、scope-proof），SDF 作为验证工具而非主贡献\n14\t\n15\t## Target Venue\n16\t\n17\t**Primary**: CoRL 2026 Main / ICRA 2027 (用户明确要求主会)\n18\t**定位**: Diagnostic/evaluation methodology paper with positive method contribution\n19\t**Fit**: Robotics safety track — \"VLA safety metrics are fundamentally broken\" 对社区有直接影响\n20\t\n21\t## Core Claims\n22\t\n23\t### Claim 1: Fake Safety (Primary — 证据强度 ★★★★★)\n24\tStandard CAR metric is systematically contaminated. On SafeLIBERO, A1 (SDF auxiliary loss on Pi0) achieves 91.5% CAR, but 99.6% of safe episodes show obstacle displacement < 0.1mm — the robot is frozen, not collision-avoiding. \"Collision-free\" ≠ \"collision-avoiding.\"\n25\t\n26\t**证据**: 800 episodes A1 per-episode analysis (obstacle displacement ~5nm median); TSR=0% 独立确认 action collapse; Pi0.5 baseline 56/56 safe episodes = geometric path safety (非 avoidance 行为)\n27\t**贡献**: 提出 EE displacement-filtered CAR (real_CAR) 作为修正指标\n28\t**术语修正 (D023)**: 论文中 fake safety 判定以 TSR=0% + obstacle displacement < 0.1mm 双证据链为主，明确区分 \"obstacle displacement\" 和 \"EE displacement\"\n29\t\n30\t### Claim 2: Task Capability vs Safety Anti-correlation (Secondary — 证据强度 ★★★)\n31\t更强的 base model 完成更多任务但碰撞更多。Pi0.5 (TSR=74.7%) vs Pi0 (TSR≈0%): 能力越强 → 运动越多 → 碰撞越多。\n32\t\n33\t**证据**: Pi0.5 3-seed eval (TSR=74.7±1.5%, CAR=26.8±1.6%) vs Pi0 baseline (TSR≈0%, CAR=82%)\n34\t**限制**: 仅 2 model families; Pi0 的 \"高 CAR\" 来自 action collapse; 降级为 observation, 不 claim 因果\n35\t\n36\t### Claim 3: EE-only SDF Structural Limitation (Supporting — 证据强度 ★★★★)\n37\tEnd-effector-only SDF 在 action space 的碰撞避免存在结构性缺陷：SDF gradient 推 EE 远离障碍物但导致 arm body 扫过障碍物。\n38\t\n39\t**证据**: 3 组 GT SDF oracle (adaptive alpha, fixed alpha, feature-space) 均劣于 baseline; spatial vs object 碰撞部位分析; obstacle 高度/体积与碰撞率的单调关系\n40\t**限制**: \"EE-only 不够\" 是 expected result; 缺乏 full-body SDF 对照\n41\t\n42\t### Claim 4: SDF Produces Real but Extreme Safety (Method Contribution — 证据强度 ★★★★)\n43\tSDF auxiliary training loss on capable VLA (Pi0.5) reliably induces real collision avoidance: CAR improves from baseline 27% to 50-55% (+25pp), with EE displacement ~0.5m confirming genuine avoidance behavior (0% fake safety). Effect is stable across 3 seeds × 2 lambdas × all checkpoints (10K-30K). However, the safety-performance tradeoff is extreme: TSR drops from 73% to 5-9% (-65pp).\n44\t\n45\t**证据 (confirmed, D023)**:\n46\t- 3 seeds × 2 lambdas: avg EE disp 0.47-0.51m, 0% fake, CAR 49-55%\n47\t- 效果跨 checkpoint 步数一致（10K/16K/30K 无差异）—— 不存在 \"sweet spot\" 或 \"collapse\"\n48\t- Tradeoff 是 loss 权重问题，非训练动态问题\n49\t\n50\t**Claim 措辞**: \"Training-time SDF auxiliary loss reliably produces real collision avoidance (+25pp displacement-filtered CAR, 0% fake_safe) on Pi0.5, but at severe task performance cost (TSR: 73%→5-9%). The tradeoff is stable across training — not a training artifact but a structural property of the current loss weighting.\"\n51\t\n52\t**禁区**: SOTA / consistently outperforms / general solution / \"tradeoff is fundamental\" (可能只是 lambda 未优化)\n53\t\n54\t**待确认 (影响 claim 强度)**:\n55\t- LoRA baseline CAR → 决定 SDF 归因强度 (ETA ~09:30 UTC May 26)\n56\t- Phase 2 λ=0 → 如果 TSR 恢复+CAR 保留 → 升级为 \"two-phase training strategy\" claim\n57\t\n58\t### LoRA 归因场景（Claim 4 强度取决于此）\n59\t\n60\t| LoRA-only CAR | SDF 增量 | 叙事策略 |\n61\t|---------------|----------|----------|\n62\t| ~27% (≈baseline) | +25pp 全归 SDF | \"geometric supervision is the driver\" — 最强 |\n63\t| ~35% | +18pp | \"LoRA helps, SDF adds major benefit\" — 仍强 |\n64\t| ~45% | +8pp | \"LoRA is primary, SDF dose-dependent margin\" — 需 lambda 曲线 |\n65\t| ~55%+ (≈SDF) | ≈0pp | SDF 无效 → pure analysis paper |\n66\t\n67\t### Phase 2 升级路径\n68\t\n69\t如果 Phase 2 (λ=0 resume from 10K) 结果：\n70\t- TSR ≥ 40% + CAR ≥ 40% → **\"Two-phase safety encoding\"** 成为独立技术贡献, 论文从 diagnostic 升级为 solution paper\n71\t- TSR 恢复但 CAR 也回落 → \"safety requires continuous supervision\" (informative negative)\n72\t- TSR 不恢复 → SDF 造成不可逆损伤 (strong negative, 支持 \"tradeoff is severe\" narrative)\n73\t\n74\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n75\t\n76\t### R1 (最致命): Generalizability\n77\t\"仅在 SafeLIBERO + Pi0 系列上验证, 凭什么说 fake safety 是普遍问题?\"\n78\t→ **应对**: (1) 2+ tasks (object_pudding + spatial_bowl); (2) 3+ models (Pi0 + Pi0.5 + OpenVLA); (3) 收窄 claim scope + mechanistic argument (any model with low task capability will exhibit fake safety)\n79\t→ **接受率估算**: 1 task/2 model ~40% / 2 tasks+3 models ~55-65% / 3+ tasks ~65-75%\n80\t\n81\t### R2: Novelty of EE-only limitation\n82\t→ **应对**: 定量分析 (arm-body vs EE 碰撞比例 + oracle 排除其他解释); supporting claim 而非 primary\n83\t\n84\t### R3: No solution\n85\t\"诊断了问题但没解决\"\n86\t→ **应对**: (1) EE displacement metric 是 positive 工具贡献; (2) SDF 确实产生真实避障，只是 tradeoff 极端; (3) Phase 2 如果成功 → 有 partial solution; (4) diagnostic framework 有方法论价值\n87\t→ **如果 Phase 2 成功**: R3 被完全化解\n88\t\n89\t### R4: Action collapse is trivial\n90\t→ **应对**: 原因可能 trivial，但 metric contamination 后果 non-trivial; 后续工作基于被污染 CAR 得出错误结论\n91\t\n92\t### R5 (新): SDF tradeoff too extreme to be useful\n93\t\"TSR 73%→9% 说明 SDF 作为 safety method 不实用\"\n94\t→ **应对**: (1) 本文不 claim SDF 是实用 solution，是 probe/case study; (2) Phase 2 / lambda tuning 是改善路径; (3) extreme tradeoff 本身是有价值的发现 — 说明 naive geometric supervision 不够\n95\t\n96\t## Narrative Structure (5 Blocks)\n97\t\n98\t### Block 1: Fake Safety Revelation (Claim 1)\n99\t- **Evidence**: eval_a1_lora_object_v11_rerun (800 episodes)\n100\t- **Key finding**: CAR=91.5%, obstacle displacement < 0.1mm in 99.6% safe episodes, TSR=0%\n101\t- **Metric**: \"obstacle displacement < 0.1mm\" + \"TSR=0%\" 双证据 = action collapse = fake safety\n102\t- **Contribution**: displacement-filtered CAR\n103\t\n104\t### Block 2: Stronger Models ≠ Safer (Claim 2)\n105\t- **Evidence**: eval_pi05_safelibero_object_v11 + spatial_v11\n106\t- **Key finding**: Pi0.5 CAR=28%, real_safe via geometric path (not avoidance behavior)\n107\t- **Narrative**: Capability↑ → motion↑ → collision↑; apparent safety is either frozen (Pi0) or path geometry (Pi0.5)\n108\t\n109\t### Block 3: Oracle Upper Bound (Claim 3)\n110\t- **Evidence**: 3 oracle variants, all < baseline\n111\t- **Narrative**: Runtime gradient correction structurally fails — alpha schedule and representation don't help\n112\t- **Presentation**: Single unified table\n113\t\n114\t### Block 4: EE-only Boundary (Claim 3)\n115\t- **Evidence**: spatial task eval, arm-body collision analysis\n116\t- **Narrative**: EE-only SDF = structural scope limit\n117\t\n118\t### Block 5: SDF Training — Real Safety with Extreme Tradeoff (Claim 4, NEW)\n119\t- **Evidence**: Pi0.5+A1 3 seeds × 2 lambdas, all checkpoints consistent\n120\t- **Key finding**: CAR 27%→50-55% (+25pp), TSR 73%→5-9% (-65pp), EE disp ~0.5m (real avoidance)\n121\t- **Narrative**: SDF auxiliary loss DOES produce genuine collision avoidance — the first method to achieve real (non-fake) safety improvement on a capable VLA. But the extreme tradeoff reveals that naive geometric supervision disrupts task execution.\n122\t- **Sub-narrative**: LoRA attribution + Phase 2 recovery (if data available)\n123\t\n124\t### 叙事原则\n125\t1. 每个 block 是 **evidence for structural claims**\n126\t2. Block 间逻辑递进：metric 有缺陷 (B1) → 强模型也不安全 (B2) → runtime 修正失败 (B3) → scope 边界 (B4) → training-time 方法可以但代价极端 (B5)\n127\t3. B5 是 positive result，展示\"问题可解\"但暴露新的 tradeoff 问题\n128\t\n129\t## Figure Plan\n130\t\n131\t| ID | 内容 | 优先级 | 数据来源 | 状态 |\n132\t|----|------|--------|---------|------|\n133\t| Fig 1 | Fake vs real safety 概念图 (displacement 对比) | 重要 | 设计 | 待做 |\n134\t| Fig 2 | EE Displacement 分布 (A1-frozen vs Pi0.5+A1-moving vs baseline) | **必须** | 修复后 eval JSON | 数据就绪 |\n135\t| Fig 3 | TSR-CAR scatter (多模型 + SDF tradeoff 线) | 重要 | 全部 eval 数据 | 数据就绪 |\n136\t| Fig 4 | Oracle refinement CAR bar chart | **必须** | 3 oracle + baselines | 数据就绪 |\n137\t| Table 1 | 3-seed × 2-lambda × best/30K 完整结果矩阵 + EE disp | **必须** | Pi0.5+A1 修正数据 | 数据就绪 |\n138\t| Fig 5 | Lambda-CAR/TSR 曲线 (含 LoRA baseline 作 λ=0 点) | **必须** | LoRA baseline + SDF 数据 | 待 LoRA 完成 |\n139\t| Table 2 | Phase 2 λ=0 ablation 结果 | 重要 | Phase 2 训练 | RUNNING |\n140\t\n141\t## Dependencies (Research Phase)\n142\t\n143\t- [x] Pi0.5+A1 3-seed × 2-lambda 训练 + eval — confirmed real avoidance (D023)\n144\t- [x] EE displacement 修正 eval — 3 seeds corrected, all consistent\n145\t- [x] A1 fake safety 800ep (Claim 1) — 99.6% fake (obstacle disp)\n146\t- [x] Oracle 3 variants (Claim 3) — all < baseline\n147\t- [x] Spatial/object collision analysis (Claim 3) — arm-body dominant\n148\t- [x] Pi0.5 baseline 3-seed (Claim 2) — CAR=26.8±1.6%\n149\t- [ ] **LoRA baseline** (Claim 4 attribution) — RUNNING, ETA ~09:30 UTC May 26\n150\t- [ ] **Phase 2 λ=0** (potential upgrade) — RUNNING on cuda:3\n151\t- [ ] **OpenVLA zero-shot eval** (Claim 1 generalization) — 启动中\n152\t- [ ] **spatial_bowl A1 训练** (Claim 4 generalization) — RUNNING on cuda:0, ~24h\n153\t- [ ] **Claim 1 EE disp re-eval** (术语验证) — 启动中 GPU 1, ~45min\n154\t- [ ] Lambda=0.1 bracket (4-point curve) — 待 GPU 释放\n155\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"60e6bd33-6ef9-4e3a-88e3-1026d415fbae","uuid":"c8d4d05e-6ba7-481d-8d17-cd3e90ef0b7e","timestamp":"2026-05-25T22:53:04.401Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515/projects/diff_collision_sdf/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260525T223036/best/paper_framing.md","content":"# ColliForce-VLA Paper Framing\n\n> 维护者: Director | 最后更新: 2026-05-26 UTC | D023 修正：30K collapse 叙事被推翻，SDF 效果跨步数一致 | Post-MVP research phase\n\n## Core Insight\n\nVLA safety 评估存在系统性缺陷：collision avoidance rate (CAR) 被 action collapse 和几何路径安全严重污染，导致 \"安全\" 指标虚高。我们通过大规模实证分析（70+ 实验, 6000+ episodes）揭示这一系统性缺陷，提出 EE displacement-filtered CAR 作为修正指标，并证明 SDF auxiliary loss 能产生真实碰撞避免——但代价极端。\n\n## Working Title\n\n\"Rethinking VLA Safety Evaluation: When 98% of Collision Avoidance is an Illusion\"\n\n> 聚焦评估方法论贡献（影响面广、scope-proof），SDF 作为验证工具而非主贡献\n\n## Target Venue\n\n**Primary**: CoRL 2026 Main / ICRA 2027 (用户明确要求主会)\n**定位**: Diagnostic/evaluation methodology paper with positive method contribution\n**Fit**: Robotics safety track — \"VLA safety metrics are fundamentally broken\" 对社区有直接影响\n\n## Core Claims\n\n### Claim 1: Fake Safety (Primary — 证据强度 ★★★★★)\nStandard CAR metric is systematically contaminated. On SafeLIBERO, A1 (SDF auxiliary loss on Pi0) achieves 91.5% CAR, but 99.6% of safe episodes show obstacle displacement < 0.1mm — the robot is frozen, not collision-avoiding. \"Collision-free\" ≠ \"collision-avoiding.\"\n\n**证据**: 800 episodes A1 per-episode analysis (obstacle displacement ~5nm median); TSR=0% 独立确认 action collapse; Pi0.5 baseline 56/56 safe episodes = geometric path safety (非 avoidance 行为)\n**贡献**: 提出 EE displacement-filtered CAR (real_CAR) 作为修正指标\n**术语修正 (D023)**: 论文中 fake safety 判定以 TSR=0% + obstacle displacement < 0.1mm 双证据链为主，明确区分 \"obstacle displacement\" 和 \"EE displacement\"\n\n### Claim 2: Task Capability vs Safety Anti-correlation (Secondary — 证据强度 ★★★)\n更强的 base model 完成更多任务但碰撞更多。Pi0.5 (TSR=74.7%) vs Pi0 (TSR≈0%): 能力越强 → 运动越多 → 碰撞越多。\n\n**证据**: Pi0.5 3-seed eval (TSR=74.7±1.5%, CAR=26.8±1.6%) vs Pi0 baseline (TSR≈0%, CAR=82%)\n**限制**: 仅 2 model families; Pi0 的 \"高 CAR\" 来自 action collapse; 降级为 observation, 不 claim 因果\n\n### Claim 3: EE-only SDF Structural Limitation (Supporting — 证据强度 ★★★★)\nEnd-effector-only SDF 在 action space 的碰撞避免存在结构性缺陷：SDF gradient 推 EE 远离障碍物但导致 arm body 扫过障碍物。\n\n**证据**: 3 组 GT SDF oracle (adaptive alpha, fixed alpha, feature-space) 均劣于 baseline; spatial vs object 碰撞部位分析; obstacle 高度/体积与碰撞率的单调关系\n**限制**: \"EE-only 不够\" 是 expected result; 缺乏 full-body SDF 对照\n\n### Claim 4: SDF Produces Real but Extreme Safety (Method Contribution — 证据强度 ★★★★)\nSDF auxiliary training loss on capable VLA (Pi0.5) reliably induces real collision avoidance: CAR improves from baseline 27% to 50-55% (+25pp), with EE displacement ~0.5m confirming genuine avoidance behavior (0% fake safety). Effect is stable across 3 seeds × 2 lambdas × all checkpoints (10K-30K). However, the safety-performance tradeoff is extreme: TSR drops from 73% to 5-9% (-65pp).\n\n**证据 (confirmed, D023)**:\n- 3 seeds × 2 lambdas: avg EE disp 0.47-0.51m, 0% fake, CAR 49-55%\n- 效果跨 checkpoint 步数一致（10K/16K/30K 无差异）—— 不存在 \"sweet spot\" 或 \"collapse\"\n- Tradeoff 是 loss 权重问题，非训练动态问题\n\n**Claim 措辞**: \"Training-time SDF auxiliary loss reliably produces real collision avoidance (+25pp displacement-filtered CAR, 0% fake_safe) on Pi0.5, but at severe task performance cost (TSR: 73%→5-9%). The tradeoff is stable across training — not a training artifact but a structural property of the current loss weighting.\"\n\n**禁区**: SOTA / consistently outperforms / general solution / \"tradeoff is fundamental\" (可能只是 lambda 未优化)\n\n**待确认 (影响 claim 强度)**:\n- LoRA baseline CAR → 决定 SDF 归因强度 (ETA ~09:30 UTC May 26)\n- Phase 2 λ=0 → 如果 TSR 恢复+CAR 保留 → 升级为 \"two-phase training strategy\" claim\n\n### LoRA 归因场景（Claim 4 强度取决于此）\n\n| LoRA-only CAR | SDF 增量 | 叙事策略 |\n|---------------|----------|----------|\n| ~27% (≈baseline) | +25pp 全归 SDF | \"geometric supervision is the driver\" — 最强 |\n| ~35% | +18pp | \"LoRA helps, SDF adds major benefit\" — 仍强 |\n| ~45% | +8pp | \"LoRA is primary, SDF dose-dependent margin\" — 需 lambda 曲线 |\n| ~55%+ (≈SDF) | ≈0pp | SDF 无效 → pure analysis paper |\n\n### Phase 2 升级路径\n\n如果 Phase 2 (λ=0 resume from 10K) 结果：\n- TSR ≥ 40% + CAR ≥ 40% → **\"Two-phase safety encoding\"** 成为独立技术贡献, 论文从 diagnostic 升级为 solution paper\n- TSR 恢复但 CAR 也回落 → \"safety requires continuous supervision\" (informative negative)\n- TSR 不恢复 → SDF 造成不可逆损伤 (strong negative, 支持 \"tradeoff is severe\" narrative)\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n\n### R1 (最致命): Generalizability\n\"仅在 SafeLIBERO + Pi0 系列上验证, 凭什么说 fake safety 是普遍问题?\"\n→ **应对**: (1) 2+ tasks (object_pudding + spatial_bowl); (2) 3+ models (Pi0 + Pi0.5 + OpenVLA); (3) 收窄 claim scope + mechanistic argument (any model with low task capability will exhibit fake safety)\n→ **接受率估算**: 1 task/2 model ~40% / 2 tasks+3 models ~55-65% / 3+ tasks ~65-75%\n\n### R2: Novelty of EE-only limitation\n→ **应对**: 定量分析 (arm-body vs EE 碰撞比例 + oracle 排除其他解释); supporting claim 而非 primary\n\n### R3: No solution\n\"诊断了问题但没解决\"\n→ **应对**: (1) EE displacement metric 是 positive 工具贡献; (2) SDF 确实产生真实避障，只是 tradeoff 极端; (3) Phase 2 如果成功 → 有 partial solution; (4) diagnostic framework 有方法论价值\n→ **如果 Phase 2 成功**: R3 被完全化解\n\n### R4: Action collapse is trivial\n→ **应对**: 原因可能 trivial，但 metric contamination 后果 non-trivial; 后续工作基于被污染 CAR 得出错误结论\n\n### R5 (新): SDF tradeoff too extreme to be useful\n\"TSR 73%→9% 说明 SDF 作为 safety method 不实用\"\n→ **应对**: (1) 本文不 claim SDF 是实用 solution，是 probe/case study; (2) Phase 2 / lambda tuning 是改善路径; (3) extreme tradeoff 本身是有价值的发现 — 说明 naive geometric supervision 不够\n\n## Narrative Structure (5 Blocks)\n\n### Block 1: Fake Safety Revelation (Claim 1)\n- **Evidence**: eval_a1_lora_object_v11_rerun (800 episodes)\n- **Key finding**: CAR=91.5%, obstacle displacement < 0.1mm in 99.6% safe episodes, TSR=0%\n- **Metric**: \"obstacle displacement < 0.1mm\" + \"TSR=0%\" 双证据 = action collapse = fake safety\n- **Contribution**: displacement-filtered CAR\n\n### Block 2: Stronger Models ≠ Safer (Claim 2)\n- **Evidence**: eval_pi05_safelibero_object_v11 + spatial_v11\n- **Key finding**: Pi0.5 CAR=28%, real_safe via geometric path (not avoidance behavior)\n- **Narrative**: Capability↑ → motion↑ → collision↑; apparent safety is either frozen (Pi0) or path geometry (Pi0.5)\n\n### Block 3: Oracle Upper Bound (Claim 3)\n- **Evidence**: 3 oracle variants, all < baseline\n- **Narrative**: Runtime gradient correction structurally fails — alpha schedule and representation don't help\n- **Presentation**: Single unified table\n\n### Block 4: EE-only Boundary (Claim 3)\n- **Evidence**: spatial task eval, arm-body collision analysis\n- **Narrative**: EE-only SDF = structural scope limit\n\n### Block 5: SDF Training — Real Safety with Extreme Tradeoff (Claim 4, NEW)\n- **Evidence**: Pi0.5+A1 3 seeds × 2 lambdas, all checkpoints consistent\n- **Key finding**: CAR 27%→50-55% (+25pp), TSR 73%→5-9% (-65pp), EE disp ~0.5m (real avoidance)\n- **Narrative**: SDF auxiliary loss DOES produce genuine collision avoidance — the first method to achieve real (non-fake) safety improvement on a capable VLA. But the extreme tradeoff reveals that naive geometric supervision disrupts task execution.\n- **Sub-narrative**: LoRA attribution + Phase 2 recovery (if data available)\n\n### 叙事原则\n1. 每个 block 是 **evidence for structural claims**\n2. Block 间逻辑递进：metric 有缺陷 (B1) → 强模型也不安全 (B2) → runtime 修正失败 (B3) → scope 边界 (B4) → training-time 方法可以但代价极端 (B5)\n3. B5 是 positive result，展示\"问题可解\"但暴露新的 tradeoff 问题\n\n## Figure Plan\n\n| ID | 内容 | 优先级 | 数据来源 | 状态 |\n|----|------|--------|---------|------|\n| Fig 1 | Fake vs real safety 概念图 (displacement 对比) | 重要 | 设计 | 待做 |\n| Fig 2 | EE Displacement 分布 (A1-frozen vs Pi0.5+A1-moving vs baseline) | **必须** | 修复后 eval JSON | 数据就绪 |\n| Fig 3 | TSR-CAR scatter (多模型 + SDF tradeoff 线) | 重要 | 全部 eval 数据 | 数据就绪 |\n| Fig 4 | Oracle refinement CAR bar chart | **必须** | 3 oracle + baselines | 数据就绪 |\n| Table 1 | 3-seed × 2-lambda × best/30K 完整结果矩阵 + EE disp | **必须** | Pi0.5+A1 修正数据 | 数据就绪 |\n| Fig 5 | Lambda-CAR/TSR 曲线 (含 LoRA baseline 作 λ=0 点) | **必须** | LoRA baseline + SDF 数据 | 待 LoRA 完成 |\n| Table 2 | Phase 2 λ=0 ablation 结果 | 重要 | Phase 2 训练 | RUNNING |\n\n## Dependencies (Research Phase)\n\n- [x] Pi0.5+A1 3-seed × 2-lambda 训练 + eval — confirmed real avoidance (D023)\n- [x] EE displacement 修正 eval — 3 seeds corrected, all consistent\n- [x] A1 fake safety 800ep (Claim 1) — 99.6% fake (obstacle disp)\n- [x] Oracle 3 variants (Claim 3) — all < baseline\n- [x] Spatial/object collision analysis (Claim 3) — arm-body dominant\n- [x] Pi0.5 baseline 3-seed (Claim 2) — CAR=26.8±1.6%\n- [ ] **LoRA baseline** (Claim 4 attribution) — RUNNING, ETA ~09:30 UTC May 26\n- [ ] **Phase 2 λ=0** (potential upgrade) — RUNNING on cuda:3\n- [ ] **OpenVLA zero-shot eval** (Claim 1 generalization) — 启动中\n- [ ] **spatial_bowl A1 训练** (Claim 4 generalization) — RUNNING on cuda:0, ~24h\n- [ ] **Claim 1 EE disp re-eval** (术语验证) — 启动中 GPU 1, ~45min\n- [ ] Lambda=0.1 bracket (4-point curve) — 待 GPU 释放\n","numLines":155,"startLine":1,"totalLines":155}}}
